/* ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
STOCKHOLM ACTIVATION SCENE
The $baileyStockholmPoints flags it reads (each earnable once):
	.offer        — First Offer Yourself
	.offerDefeat — Offered after beating Bailey 5+ times
	.temple       — Defended Bailey to Jordan at the temple
	.kylar        — Defended Bailey to Jordan during the Kylar rescue
	.cafe         — Praised/reassured Bailey at the chef opening
	.gwylan       — Gwylan told PC "You sound like Bailey"
	.whitney      — Spread legs for Bailey during the Whitney office sex
	.kick         — Licked Bailey's shoe during the sell-kick
	.avery        — Told Avery you're grateful at the Valentine's date
══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ */
:: Bailey Stockholm Reveal
<<pass 15>><<effects>>
<<person1>>

<<He>> lets go of your arm and sits behind <<his>> desk.
<br><br>

"I keep records," <<he>> says.<<if $hacker_tasks.includes("bailey")>> "But you already know that, you little shit."<</if>>
<br><br>

<<He>> reaches into <<his>> jacket and produces a folder with your name on it. <span class="red">They're your identification papers.</span>
<br><br>

<<if $baileyStockholmPoints.temple or $baileyStockholmPoints.kylar>>
	<<He>> opens the folder. "You vouched for me to Jordan and <<nnpc_his "Jordan">> god-botherers.<<if $baileyStockholmPoints.temple>> At the temple, that I take care of you.<</if>><<if $baileyStockholmPoints.kylar>> In that little freak's basement, you ran your mouth about how much you loved it here.<</if>>"
	<br><br>
<</if>>

<<if $baileyStockholmPoints.cafe or $baileyStockholmPoints.halloween or $baileyStockholmPoints.gwylan or $baileyStockholmPoints.avery>>
	<<if $baileyStockholmPoints.temple or $baileyStockholmPoints.kylar>><<He>> turns a page.<<else>><<He>> opens the folder.<</if>> "<<if $baileyStockholmPoints.cafe>>At the café opening, you could've made trouble for me. You vouched for this place instead. <</if>><<if $baileyStockholmPoints.halloween>>At the orphanage gala, you spun your little tale about the orphanage when given the opportunity to speak. <</if>><<if $baileyStockholmPoints.avery>>That idiot on Danube Street went fishing for dirt on me. You gave <<nnpc_him "Avery">> nothing. <</if>><<if $baileyStockholmPoints.gwylan>>The shopkeep says you sound like me. That I raised you wrong.<</if>>"
	<br><br>
<</if>>

<<He>> closes the folder, tosses it onto the desk, and fixes you with a level stare.
<br><br>

"You let me put a hood on you and tie you down," <<he>> says, <<his>> mouth partially obscured by <<his>> steepled fingers. "You let me sell you, even when you can afford the rent<<if $baileyStockholmPoints.offerDefeat>>, even when you can knock me to the floor<</if>>.<<if $baileyStockholmPoints.whitney>> You spread your legs for me while that useful idiot watched.<</if>><<if $baileyStockholmPoints.kick>> You licked my shoe in the tunnel.<</if>>"
<br><br>

The chair groans beneath <<his>> weight as <<he>> leans back.
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Bailey Stockholm Reveal 2]]>><</link>>


:: Bailey Stockholm Reveal 2
<<effects>><<speechresolve>>
<<person1>>

<<if (_speechAttitudeResolved is "meek" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy")>>
	Bailey stares at you. You shift your feet and rub your thumb across your palm.
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "polite" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant")>>
	Bailey stares at you. You keep your hands at your sides and wait for <<him>> to speak.
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
	Bailey stares at you. You lower your head and remain where <<he>> left you.
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "confident">>
	Bailey stares at you. You square your shoulders and look straight back at <<him>>.
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty">>
	Bailey stares at you. You fold your arms and refuse to look away.
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel">>
	Bailey stares at you. You step closer, forcing <<him>> to lift <<his>> chin to keep watching you.
<<else>>
	Bailey stares right at you. You stare back, waiting for <<him>> to speak.
<</if>>
<br><br>

"I kept waiting for your angle," <<he>> says after a long while. "Then I figured it out."
<br><br>

You don't say anything. <<He>> stands, rounds the desk, and stops in front of you<<if $bodysize lte 1>>, looking down at you<<elseif $bodysize gte 3>>, having to look up at you this close<</if>>, <<his>> eyes taking all of you in.
<br><br>

"You want to prove yourself," <<he>> says. "What you can do. Whose you are."
<br><br>

<<His>> hand comes up. For a moment you think <<hes>> going to hit you. <<His>> fingers brush the side of your neck instead.
<br><br>

<<He>> leans in, <<his>> lips close enough to your ear that you feel the ghost of <<his>> breath. "Mine."
<br><br>

Then <<his>> hand drops. <<He>> reaches into <<his>> coat.
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Bailey Stockholm Collar]]>><</link>>


:: Bailey Stockholm Collar
<<pass 10>><<effects>>
<<person1>>
<<if $worn.neck.name is "Whitney's collar" or $worn.neck.name is "Whitney's collar with leash">>
	<<His>> eyes drop to your neck.
	<br><br>

	<<He>> takes your jaw in one hand and tilts your head to get a better look at Whitney's collar. The corner of <<his>> mouth lifts.
	<br><br>

	"Whitney can pretend all <<nnpc_he "Whitney">> likes," <<he>> says. "But <<nnpc_he "Whitney">> knows who you belong to."
	<br><br>

	<<He>> produces a pair of bolt cutters from <<his>> desk drawer. The collar comes off in one clean cut. <<He>> drops it in the bin.
	<br><br>
	<<set $worn.neck.type.push("broken")>>
	<<neckruined>>

<<elseif $worn.neck.name is "familiar collar" and $worn.neck.cursed is 1>>
	<<His>> eyes drop to your neck. <<He>> goes still at the sight of your collar. The heart glows a dim green, reflected in <<his>> eyes as <<he>> runs a finger along the length of it. <<His>> touch is warm. You shiver.
	<br><br>

	"That witch marked you." <<He>> doesn't touch it. Instead, <<he>> opens <<his>> desk drawer and reaches deep in the back of it. <<He>> produces a tuning fork.
	<br><br>

	"This is going to hurt," <<he>> says. <<He>> hits the tuning fork against <<his>> desk and brings it slowly towards the heart of your collar.
	<br><br>

	<<pass 5>>The tuning fork touches the heart. The heart seems to scream. Your neck burns. Your vision blurs.<<gpain>><<pain 6>><<gstress>><<stress 8>><<gwylanHypnosis "devotion" -15>>
	<br><br>

	The heart turns blood red. The collar unlatches from your neck, into Bailey's hands.
	<br><br>

	<<set $worn.neck.cursed to 0>>
	<<set $worn.neck.type.push("broken")>>
	<<neckruined>>
	<<He>> tosses it in the wastebin.
	<br><br>

<<elseif $worn.neck.name isnot "naked">>
	<<His>> eyes drop to your neck and the $worn.neck.name you have on. <<He>> tugs it off and drops it in <<his>> wastebin without looking at it.
	<br><br>
	<<set $worn.neck.type.push("broken")>>
	<<neckruined>>
<</if>>

<<He>> pulls out a strip of dark leather. It's a collar with no tag. The clasp is a small lotus flower that comes together in the front.
<br><br>

<<He>> holds it out so you can see it. "Don't lose it. If you lose it, you pay for the next one."
<br><br>

<<He>> steps closer to you. <<His>> hands are steady as <<he>> places the leather around your neck. It settles against your throat. You hear the clasp close with a small click. The lotus flower sits at the hollow of your neck.
<br><br>

<<His>> fingers rest on the back of your neck for one moment. Then <<he>> steps away.
<br><br>

<<set _collarIdx to setup.clothes.neck.findIndex(function(item) { return item.name === "Bailey's collar"; })>><<if _collarIdx gte 0>><<neckwear _collarIdx>><</if>>
<<baileySeenAdd "collar">>
<<set $syndromeBailey to true>>
<<run C.npc.Bailey.dom = 100>>
<<He>> sits back behind <<his>> desk. <<He>> picks up <<his>> pen.
<br><br>

"Rent's due next week," <<he>> says. "You can go."<<npcincr Bailey love 5>><<ggglove "Bailey">>
<br><br>

<span class="bailey-stockholm"><i>Stockholm Syndrome: Bailey</i></span>
<br>
<span class="red"><i>Bailey can now be set as a Love Interest.</i></span>
<br><br>

You touch your neck as you leave. <span class="bailey-red">The lotus flower collar might be recognizable to some.</span>
<br><br>

<span class="grey"><i>Choose collar art style:</i></span>
<br>
<span id="collar-listbox"><<lotus_listbox>></span>
<br>
<<lotus_collar_buttons>>
<br><br>
<span class="grey"><i>You can change this later in Bailey's office.</i></span>
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Orphanage]]>><<endevent>><</link>>


:: Bailey Collar Request
<<pass 5>><<effects>>
<<person1>>

<<if $baileyCollarTaken>>
	<<He>> looks at your neck. <<He>> already knows.
	<br><br>

	"Whitney took it." It's not a question. <<He>> holds <<his>> hand out. "<<printprice 1000000>>."
	<br><br>
<<else>>
	<<He>> looks at your neck.
	<br><br>

	"You lost it." It's not a question. <<He>> holds <<his>> hand out. "<<printprice 1000000>>."
	<br><br>
<</if>>

<<if setup.inflation.canAfford(1000000, "baileyCollar")>>
