:: Bailey Bath Rescue
Heavy footsteps respond to your cry, growing closer. The trio recoil and scramble for the door handle. The door swings open and someone fills the door frame. <span class="bailey-red">It's <<baileyTitleNarration>>.</span> <<His>> eyes scan the room, taking in the trio of orphans and your state of distress.
<br><br>

"Stupid brats," Bailey sneers, reaching forward and grabbing the arms of two of the orphans. <<He>> glares at the third, who <<he>> doesn't have enough arms for. "You three are coming with me."<<lstress>><<stress -6>>
<br><br>

<<He>> drags them out of the room with <<him>> without sparing you a glance.

:: Temple Bailey Intro Vouch
<<endevent>>
<<effects>><<speechresolve>><<npc Bailey>><<person1>><<npc Jordan 2>>

<<person2>>Jordan looks at you with a worried expression. "Is everything okay, <<sister>>?" <<he>> asks. "That is your guardian, correct?"
<br><br>

<<person1>>You step closer to Bailey. <<person2>>Jordan watches, <<his>> gentle expression unchanged.
<br><br>

<<if (_speechAttitudeResolved is "meek" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy")>>
	"B-Bailey takes good care of us," you say. Your voice carries further than you intended. "I don't want anyone to worry."
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "polite" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant")>>
	"Your concern is kind, Jordan, but Bailey provides for us," you say. "Please accept my word that we are safe."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
	You stay close to Bailey. "My guardian takes care of us. I don't want Bailey to get in trouble."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "confident">>
	"Bailey provides for the orphanage," you say clearly. "I came here to vouch for my guardian, and I stand by it."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty">>
	"Bailey looks after me," you say flatly. "Better than most would. We don't need anyone's concern."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel">>
	You place yourself between Jordan and Bailey. "You heard me vouch for my guardian. Stop asking questions."
<<else>>
	"My guardian has nothing to answer for," you say. "Bailey provides for us. That's more than most can say."
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<person1>>Bailey hasn't moved. <<He>> is looking directly at you with a warm smile that twitches on one side.
<br><br>

"I'll see you in a week," <<he>> says. Then <<he>> turns, strides down the centre aisle, and leaves the temple.<<npcincr Bailey dom 3>><<gggdom "Bailey">><<npcincr Bailey love 3>><<ggglove "Bailey">><<if !$baileyStockholmPoints.temple>><<set $syndromeBaileyBuild += 1>><<set $baileyStockholmPoints.temple to true>><<gbaileystock>><</if>>
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Temple]]>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: Kylar Abduction Free Rescue Defend
<<effects>><<speechresolve>>

<<person2>>
<<if (_speechAttitudeResolved is "meek" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy")>>
	"B-Bailey is a wonderful guardian..." you say to Jordan, keeping your eyes on the floor. "I-I'm sorry for causing trouble."
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "polite" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant")>>
	"I appreciate your concern, Jordan, but Bailey provides everything I need," you say. "There is no reason to investigate <<him>>."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
	You move to Bailey's side. "<<He>> takes care of me. Please don't cause trouble for <<him>> because of this."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "confident">>
	"Bailey looks after me," you tell Jordan. "I can speak for myself, and I'm telling you we're fine."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty">>
	"Bailey looks after me," you say to Jordan, tilting your chin up. "Better than most would. We're fine."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel">>
	You step between Jordan and Bailey. "Save your concern for someone who asked. Bailey stays."
<<else>>
	"There's nothing to be concerned about," you say to Jordan. "Bailey takes good care of me."
<</if>>
<br><br>

Bailey's eyes widen slightly before <<his>> expression softens.<<npcincr Bailey dom 3>><<npcincr Bailey love 3>><<set $syndromeBaileyBuild += 1>><<set $baileyStockholmPoints.kylar to true>><<gggdom "Bailey">><<ggglove "Bailey">><<gbaileystock>>
<br><br>

